      {
        "id": "don-t-fall-for-these-common-misconceptions",
        "title": "Don't fall for these common misconceptions",
        "description": null,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "cards",
            "cards": [
              {
                "title": "",
                "text": "“I just need a service - it'll sort it out.” A service won't fix a failing turbo, timing chain, or injectors. Get diagnosed first.",
                "highlight": "",
                "meta": "",
                "icon": "",
                "items": [],
                "fullText": "“I just need a service - it'll sort it out.” A service won't fix a failing turbo, timing chain, or injectors. Get diagnosed first."
              },
              {
                "title": "",
                "text": "“It's probably the fuel filter - cheap fix.” Sometimes. But in 85% of cases, it's something more expensive.",
                "highlight": "",
                "meta": "",
                "icon": "",
                "items": [],
                "fullText": "“It's probably the fuel filter - cheap fix.” Sometimes. But in 85% of cases, it's something more expensive."
              },
              {
                "title": "",
                "text": "“Loss of power means I need a new engine.” Rarely. Most power loss cases are sensors, injectors, or turbos - not engine failure.",
                "highlight": "",
                "meta": "",
                "icon": "",
                "items": [],
                "fullText": "“Loss of power means I need a new engine.” Rarely. Most power loss cases are sensors, injectors, or turbos - not engine failure."
              },
              {
                "title": "",
                "text": "“I'll drive it gently and it'll be fine.” Gentle driving masks the problem. If the timing chain has stretched, it will fail catastrophically.",
                "highlight": "",
                "meta": "",
                "icon": "",
                "items": [],
                "fullText": "“I'll drive it gently and it'll be fine.” Gentle driving masks the problem. If the timing chain has stretched, it will fail catastrophically."
              }
            ]
